Norway,NOR,7.10 Are medical services part of the domaine réservé?,Silent,,,,
Pakistan,PAK,1. Is the prohibition of non-intervention a norm of customary international law?,Yes,"“Pakistan believes that the principles of non-use of force, sovereign equality of all nations, non-interventionism, and peaceful settlement of disputes, as enshrined in the UN Charter, continue to apply in cyberspace as in the physical world.”","Pakistan’s Position on the Application of International Law in Cyberspace, pg. 3, ¶ 6 (2023).",https://perma.cc/T37B-BEDR,
